@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #fffefa
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #30203e
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6a5c70
  ArrowFontColor #30203e
  ArrowFontSize 13
  LifeLineBorderColor #8c7a97
  ParticipantBorderColor #6a5c70
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #eee7f9
  ParticipantFontColor #30203e
  ActorBorderColor #6a5c70
  ActorBackgroundColor #fffefa
  ActorFontColor #30203e
  GroupBorderColor #6a5c70
  GroupBackgroundColor #f6f3ee
  GroupHeaderFontColor #30203e
  DividerBorderColor #8c7a97
  DividerBackgroundColor #f6f3ee
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #fff7e3
  BorderColor #8c7a97
  FontColor #30203e
  FontSize 12
}

actor User
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "Application Core" as Core
participant "Sync Transport" as Sync

Core -> Core: Assess pending synchronization
opt Sync configured and changes pending
  Core --> UI: Synchronization choice needed
  UI -> User: Sync then close, or retain changes
  User -> UI: Choose
  UI -> Core: Return choice

  alt Sync then close
    Core -> Sync: Exchange pending data
    note over Core, Sync: Keep workspace and required transport active
    Sync --> Core: Exchange outcome
    alt Offline, conflict or failure
      Core --> UI: Still pending; workspace stays open
      UI --> User: Show unresolved state
    else Synchronization succeeds
      Core -> Core: Sync condition satisfied
    end
  else Close now, retaining local changes
    Core -> Core: Preserve changes for reopening
  end
end

note over UI, Core
  Closure continues only when its conditions are met.
  Local-only workspaces have no synchronization prerequisite.
end note
@enduml
